This project contains a port of third-party code:

OpenPeerEscrow.sol
  Source:  https://github.com/openpeer/openpeer_contracts
  File:    contracts/OpenPeerEscrow.sol
  Commit:  34f8d24e92f42b3da67fb89d83c42970d99eb452
  License: MIT (SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT in the file header)
  Authors: the OpenPeer contributors

The escrow flow (create, mark as paid, release, buyer cancel, seller cancel
after a waiting time, dispute with a fee from both parties, arbitrator
resolution, fee in basis points) follows that contract. The code in
contracts/ is a rewrite for the Bitcoin Cash UTXO model in SolidCash, not a
copy. docs/PORTING.md maps each function, event and modifier of the original
to its counterpart here or records why it was dropped.

